WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.760
Hey guys, how's it going, it's Justine and today I'm unboxing something

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.040
that my friend Francesca bought me for my birthday which,

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.940
At this point was quite a while ago,

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.120
But I've been saving it because I wanted to open it for you guys because this is super, super cool

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.080
It's called Furbo.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.260
And basically what it is, is

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.540
I know a lot of you guys have probably seen nest cameras,

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.180
And other types of dog webcams,

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.120
But this one

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.680
will, actually, give your dog a treat.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:28.040
You can take photos and videos, there's a treat toss, and there's a two-way talk.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.980
Live video streaming,

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.760
two-way audio barking alert, photos and videos, and smart privacy.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.320
Let's check it out!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.940
What I'm most excited about is being able to give Matty a treat while I'm away.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:44.100
I'm not a huge fan of talking to him, because I don't want him to get confused

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.520
and get upset because he thinks that I'm in the house and I'm not.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.920
But I absolutely love the fact that it is streaming live video,

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.460
Oh wow!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.900
It looks really good too!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:53.780
So here it is,

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:54.960
still comes with the Furbo.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.600
Oh, Matty's coming in here.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.620
He knows somethin's for him!

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.700
Got a charger,

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.800
and it looks like this is just a simple micro USB charger, which is fantastic.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:05.400
Plug it in.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.620
Download the app.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.440
And that's it.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.740
So it says, "Getting my Furbo ready"

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.320
so it looks like it's going to be connecting it to Bluetooth.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:17.500
and that's whats happening, so it's--i'ts finding it right now.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:18.760
*beep beep*

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.140
Here's the setup process, it says it takes 3 to 5 minutes.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.500
So I guess I'll just, be right back.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.480
These aren't exactly treats, so I don't think he's gonna be that into it,

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.380
but, at least we'll be able to see if it works.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:34.000
This has like a nice little air-tight seal to it so your treats won't get spoiled.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.340
Oh! My setup is complete. That was way less than 3 to 5 minutes.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.600
*gasps* It worked!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:39.680
It's up!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.500
Ok, so you can slide a treat,

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.380
ok, ok.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.000
You do this to slide a treat.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.160
*mechanical whirring*

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.580
O-oh my god!

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.660
It threw several treats!

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.020
Matty, want treat?

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.560
Look Matty, watch! Ready?

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.540
Take a picture--hi baby!

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.760
What do you think?

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.260
Does your dog--I think he loves it?

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.960
Maybe if we got some better treats in there, you might like it?

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:22.220
The problem is he doesn't want to eat dog food!

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:23.520
Well this is what I'll do,

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.200
I'm gonna put a good treat in here.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.800
Ok Matty, these--these are good treats.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.680
Get the treat, Matty!

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:32.860
C'mere, look!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.180
There you go, honey.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.600
That's for you!

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.340
He took it, he took it, he took it!

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:44.140
So the key here is, uh, not using dog food, and using delicious treats.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.760
Good boy! Yes, that's my man!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.380
That's my main man!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.160
My tip to you guys, is use your dog's favorite treat.

00:02:59.260 --> 00:02:59.760
These,

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:01.040
way too small.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.980
It shot out like 50 of 'em!

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:07.440
Well thank you guys so much for watching, a huge thank you to Francesca for getting me this incredible device

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.840
because this is awesome!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:12.940
I'll put a link in the description if you guys want to check this out, or get one yourself for your dog.

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:16.360
But in the meantime, I'm gonna go clean up the dog food mess that I just made. *laughs*

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.980
Matty, come here honey!

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.120
C'mere baby!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.320
He knows that I don't have anymore treats, so why would he listen?

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.220
(Music)

